From: Project SunUEFI
Subject: [PATCH] sensors: discover complete SSC metadata without sampling

Add default/all-instance SUID discovery and preserve every attribute value
and original protobuf byte. Extend the existing public raw-report client
with a metadata-only mode and keep the normal Debian/Meson build entry.
No sensor reports, registry updates or new background services are enabled
by metadata discovery. Record the new exported symbols as +sunuefi3.

